  "word_count": 611,
  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n# Book an Appointment Now\n\n\nWe are here to assist you. Reach out to us for any inquiries or appointments.\n\nContact Us\n\n\n## Fill Form Below to Book Appointment\n\n\nFirst Name\n\nLast Name\n\nEmail\n\nPhone Number\n\nPreferred Days *\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nPreferred Times\n\nAM\n\nPM\n\nAnytime\n\nASAP!\n\nContact Method\n\nCall me\n\nEmail me\n\nText me\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit\n\n\n### What Happens Next?\n\n\nAfter you complete the form, we will contact you to schedule your appointment via your preferred method. If we can't meet your exact request, we will reach out to arrange a convenient time. We will do our best to accommodate your schedule!\n\n\n### Emergencies\n\n\nIf you are experiencing pain or an emergency, we will do our best to see you the same day. We strive to stay on schedule to minimize waiting, but sometimes procedures take longer or emergencies cause delays. We appreciate your understanding and patience.\n\n\n### Cancellation Policy\n\n\nWe set aside dedicated time in our office for your dental appointment. If you find it necessary to cancel, please provide 24-hour advance notice.\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
